WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.016
I'll host your personal data right here. 'The cloud.'

00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:13.694
Define 'cloud' first. The sky kind, or the other kind?

00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:16.021
Both. Both of them.

00:00:16.021 --> 00:00:22.194
One audit question. 'Where is the personal data, physically?'

00:00:22.194 --> 00:00:26.026
A physical address? That's… up in the sky.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:31.039
I thought the sky had an address.

00:00:32.858 --> 00:00:38.998
Our personal data lives behind our own wall. Address: our place.

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:41.044
Audit: that's enough.

